# AppleScript: AppleScript Language Guide (Apple), Lexical Conventions; requirements/languages/applescript.md
name     applescript osascript
keyword  tell end if then else repeat with from to by while until return on set to get copy of in the
keyword  and or not is contains try error considering ignoring using script property global local my
keyword  every whose where returning
builtin  true false missing value me it display dialog activate quit log
line-comment   -- #
block-comment  (* *)  : nested
string   " "  : escapes
operators  &=<>+-*/^
